<h2>2. Integrated SEO Keywords (38 Target Terms)</h2>
<p>The landing page content dynamically swaps <strong>[Area Name]</strong> for the active neighborhood to capture search intent. Here are the 38 target keywords we successfully embedded:</p>

<h3>Core & Platform Keywords</h3>
<ul>
  <li>software-courses-in-[Area Name]</li>
  <li>online-learning-platform-in-[Area Name]</li>
  <li>learning-management-system-in-[Area Name]</li>
  <li>online-courses-in-[Area Name]</li>
  <li>e-learning-platform-in-[Area Name]</li>
  <li>professional-online-courses-in-[Area Name]</li>
  <li>self-paced-learning-in-[Area Name]</li>
  <li>skill-development-courses-in-[Area Name]</li>
  <li>online-certification-courses-in-[Area Name]</li>
