</ul>

<h2>3. How the Keywords are Distributed in the Content</h2>
<p>To maximize keyword weight without triggering Google's spam algorithms (keyword stuffing), the keywords are woven naturally into the local landing page structure, local FAQs, and the custom JSON-LD schema dynamically.</p>

<ul>
  <li><strong>Dynamic Landing Pages:</strong> Swaps the title and core headers to match the exact keyword the user searched (e.g. <em>SQL Online Course in Velachery</em>).</li>
  <li><strong>Structured FAQ Section:</strong> Swaps the main keywords and locations within the question and answer text dynamically to align with user search intent.</li>
  <li><strong>JSON-LD Local Schema:</strong> Generates dynamic course schemas (e.g. <em>Course</em> entity named <em>SQL Online Course in Velachery</em>) that mirror the page's exact focus keyword for maximized indexing authority.</li>
</ul>

